  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Copenhagen Gl\u00f8d Index Close No. Section 01 Home 02 Menus 03 Events 04 Private dining 05 Story No. Section 06 Journal 07 Gift cards 08 Visit 09 Book a table 10 All pages Find us J\u00e6gersborggade 41, 2200 K\u00f8benhavn N Open Wednesday to Saturday, 17:30 to 23:00 Talk to us [email protected] +00 00 00 00 00 Private dining The counter Eight stools at the fire. Freja cooks in front of you and tells you what she is doing, if you ask. Plan an event Plan an event About the room About the room Seated Up to 8 Season All year Minimum spend 6.000 kr Menu Written by Freja The room The counter faces the hearth, close enough to feel the heat. Book all eight stools and it is yours for the night. Freja cooks a longer menu here than in the dining room, one small plate at a time, straight from the embers to your plate. Expect around ten courses and a lot of questions answered. The menu A tasting menu written for the evening, with a wine or juice pairing. Tell us what anyone does not eat and we cook around it. Good for Small celebrations, cooks and curious eaters, and anyone who wants to watch the fire. Minimum spend 6.000 kr. We reply within two days. Plan an event Plan an event Other room",
